#: kcmaccess.cpp:239
msgid "kaccess"
msgstr "kaccess"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:239
msgid "KDE Accessibility Tool"
msgstr "KDE-Behinnertenwarktüüch"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:241
msgid "(c) 2000, Matthias Hoelzer-Kluepfel"
msgstr "(c) 2000, Matthias Hölzer-Klüpfel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:243
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Autor"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Toonpingel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:268
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "&Systeempingel bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:270
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "&Egen Pingel bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:272
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt de Standardsysteempingel bruukt. Wenn Du ehr instellen "
"wullt, denn kiek binnen dat Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Kläng un Multimedia\" ünner "
"\"Systeempingel\" na. Normalerwies is dat bloots en \"Piep\"."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:275
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.<p> "
"Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the event "
"causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du disse Optschoon anmaakst, kannst Du en Klangdatei för de Pingel "
"fastleggen. Wenn Du dat deist, schullst Du de Systeempingel utmaken.<p> Op "
"langsame Reekners kann dat wull wesen, dat dor en lütt Tiet twischen "
"Begeefnis un Klang liggt.</p>"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:284
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "&Klang för't Afspelen:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:288
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Utsöken..."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:290
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Optschoon \"Egen Pingel bruken\" anmaakt is, kannst Du hier en Datei "
"utsöken. Klick op \"Utsöken...\", wenn Du en Datei op dien Reekner utsöken "
"wullt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:307
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:315
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel br&uken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:317
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Disse Optschoon maakt de \"Ogenpingel\" an. T.B. bluckt de Schirm op, wenn "
"normalerwies de Pingel geiht. Dat is goot för doof Lüüd."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:325
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Klöre&n ümkehren"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:330
msgid "All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "All Klören op den Schirm warrt för de nerrn fastleggte Tiet ümkehrt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:332
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Schirm opb&lucken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:334
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr ""
"De Schirm warrt för de nerrn fastleggte Tiet mit en sülven instellte Klöör "
"infarvt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:340
msgid "Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""
"Klicken hier, wenn Du de Klöör utsöken wullt, mit de de Schirm bi't "
"Opblucken infarvt warrt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:349
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Wo lang:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:350 kcmaccess.cpp:470 kcmaccess.cpp:512
msgid " msec"
msgstr " ms"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:352
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo lang de \"Ogenpingel\" wiest warrt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:369
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Pingel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:379
msgid "S&ticky Keys"
msgstr "&Backige Tasten"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:387
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "Backige Ta&sten bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:394
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr "\"Backige Tasten\" f&aststellen"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:401
msgid "Turn sticky keys off when two keys are pressed simultaneously"
msgstr "\"Backige Tasten\" utmaken, wenn twee Tasten to de sülve Tiet drückt warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:408
msgid "Use system bell whenever a modifier gets latched, locked or unlocked"
msgstr ""
"Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Sünnertast faststellt, blockeert oder "
"freegeven warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:411
msgid "Locking keys"
msgstr "Faststelltasten"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:419
msgid "Use system bell whenever a locking key gets activated or deactivated"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Faststelltast aktiv oder inaktiv warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:422
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a modifier or locking key "
"changes its state"
msgstr ""
"KDE-Systeemnaricht bruken, wenn en Sünner- oder Faststelltast den Tostand "
"ännert"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:446
msgid "&Modifier Keys"
msgstr "&Sünnertasten"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:454
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "&Langsame Tasten"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:462
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "Langsame Tasten br&uken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:472
msgid "Acceptance dela&y:"
msgstr "&Tiet ehr övernahmen warrt:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:479
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is pressed"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast drückt warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:486
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is accepted"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast övernahmen warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:493
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast torüchwiest warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:496
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "Springen Tasten"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:504
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "Springe&n Tasten bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:514
msgid "D&ebounce time:"
msgstr "Ti&et ehr de Tast torüchspringt:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:521
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Tast torüchwiest warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:539
msgid "&Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "&Tastatuurfiltern"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:548 kcmaccess.cpp:620
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "Anmaaktekens"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:556
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr "Tekens för't Anmaken vun Backige un Langsame Tasten bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:560
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Tastatuurtekens aktiveren, de disse Metoden anmaakt: \n"
"Backige Tasten: Drück de Ümschalttast 5 Maal in een Reeg naenanner\n"
"Langsame Tasten: Laat de Ümschalttast för 8 Sekunnen daaldrückt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:564
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Tastatuurtekens aktiveren, de disse Metoden anmaakt:\n"
"Muustasten: %1\n"
"Backige Tasten: Drück de Ümschalttast 5 Maal in een Reeg naenanner\n"
"Langsame Tasten: Laat de Ümschalttast för 8 Sekunnen daaldrückt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:569
msgid "Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain time of inactivity"
msgstr "Backige un Langsame Tasten na en wiss Tiet utmaken, wenn nix daan warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:577
msgid " min"
msgstr " Min."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:579
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "Paus:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:582
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "Naricht"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:590
msgid ""
"Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility "
"feature on or off"
msgstr ""
"Jümmers de Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Behinnertenwarktüüch mit en Teken "
"an- oder utmaakt warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:593
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is "
"turned on or off"
msgstr "Jümmers nafragen, wenn en Behinnertenwarktüüch an- oder utmaakt warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:595
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Be carefull to know what you are doing if you uncheck it as then the "
"keyboard accessibility settings will always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, fraagt KDE jümmers na, wenn en Tastatuurmetood an- oder utmaakt warrt.\n"
"Bitte wees Di dor över kloor, wat Du deist, wenn Du dit utmaakst - de "
"Instellen för Tastatuurmetoden warrt denn jümmers ahn Nafraag övernahmen."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:597
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility "
"feature is turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"Jümmers de KDE-Systeemnarichten bruken, wenn en Behinnertenwarktüüch an- "
"oder utmaakt warrt"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:649
msgid "*.wav|WAV Files"
msgstr "*.wav|WAV-Dateien"

